BAUX Session Registry Database Service

The BAUX session registry maintains a centralized database of tmux session
locations across the BAUX-MESH network. It tracks which sessions are running
on which nodes, enabling seamless session discovery and migration.

Features:
- SQLite-based session registry
- Node and session tracking
- Automatic cleanup of stale sessions
- RESTful API integration ready
- Mesh network session discovery

